control: A mutation patch is refused when a hunk's context matches at more than one place in its file
removes: a hunk git holds to the start or the end of its file is matched anywhere, so one whose context repeats elsewhere is refused though git gives it one place
packages: ./testsupport/cmd/mutproof/...
tests: TestHunkMatchCountsByGitsAnchors
scheduled-count: no

